DESCRIPTION:WADADA RUN CLUB — RAE SPECIAL\nAt-home pink awareness run\,
  named after WRC's Lyrae.\nSaturday\, October 24\, 2026. Start at 5:30 P
 M.\n1. Run at least 1 km inside your house and track it.\n2. Wear pink\,
  take a photo or video\, post to your socials and tag @wadadarunclub and
  @jamaicacancersociety with #raisingawareness.\n3. Send your photo or vi
 deo in HD to the WRC social group.\n4. Have fun!\nThe in-person Pink Run
  at Emancipation Park is CANCELLED due to rain. There is no in-person me
 etup.\nCalendar end time 6:00 PM is only a placeholder\; no finish time 
 was announced.\niOS reminders: 12 hours and 2 hours ahead.
